{"id":"41d2a9a0a4a14286","group":"58","path":"58/batch11/58-df-zfc-tree9-barrier.md","title":"Barrier on an Infinite Subset of Omega","display":"df-zfc-tree9-barrier — Barrier on an Infinite Subset of Omega","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-tree9-barrier","aliases":["58-df-zfc-tree9-barrier"],"display":"df-zfc-tree9-barrier — Barrier on an Infinite Subset of Omega","depends_on":["[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","[[../batch01/58-df-equinumerous.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-tree9-barrier"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-tree9-barrier</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-tree9-barrier — Barrier on an Infinite Subset of Omega"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md\">../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"28c79fde9f892bfe\" href=\"?note=28c79fde9f892bfe\" title=\"../batch01/58-df-equinumerous.md\">../batch01/58-df-equinumerous.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"df-zfc-tree9-barrier-—-ZFC-Tree9-Barrier\">df-zfc-tree9-barrier — ZFC Tree9 Barrier</h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B,X,Y,b\\in V\">\\(B,X,Y,b\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FiniteInitialSegment}_S,\\mathrm{ZfcTree9Barrier}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{FiniteInitialSegment}_S,\\mathrm{ZfcTree9Barrier}_S\\)</span> (predicates defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}tree9\\text{-}barrier} \\vdash \\mathrm{FiniteInitialSegment}_S(b,Y)\\leftrightarrow \\exists n\\in\\omega\\;(b=Y\\cap n)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}tree9\\text{-}barrier} \\vdash \\mathrm{FiniteInitialSegment}_S(b,Y)\\leftrightarrow \\exists n\\in\\omega\\;(b=Y\\cap n)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}tree9\\text{-}barrier} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcTree9Barrier}_S(B,X)\\leftrightarrow X\\subseteq\\omega\\land X\\approx\\omega\\land B\\subseteq[X]^{&lt;\\omega}\\land\\forall a,b\\in B\\;(a\\neq b\\to\\neg(a\\subseteq b\\lor b\\subseteq a))\\land\\forall Y\\in[X]^\\omega\\;\\exists b\\in B\\;\\mathrm{FiniteInitialSegment}_S(b,Y)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}tree9\\text{-}barrier} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcTree9Barrier}_S(B,X)\\leftrightarrow X\\subseteq\\omega\\land X\\approx\\omega\\land B\\subseteq[X]^{&lt;\\omega}\\land\\forall a,b\\in B\\;(a\\neq b\\to\\neg(a\\subseteq b\\lor b\\subseteq a))\\land\\forall Y\\in[X]^\\omega\\;\\exists b\\in B\\;\\mathrm{FiniteInitialSegment}_S(b,Y)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The last clause uses the increasing-order initial segment of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Y\">\\(Y\\)</span>, which is stronger than arbitrary inclusion <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"b\\subseteq Y\">\\(b\\subseteq Y\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"df-zfc-tree9-barrier-—-ZFC-Tree9-Barrier","text":"df-zfc-tree9-barrier — ZFC Tree9 Barrier","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch01/58-df-equinumerous.md","status":"resolved","id":"28c79fde9f892bfe","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch01/58-df-equinumerous.md]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"B,X,Y,b\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{FiniteInitialSegment}_S,\\mathrm{ZfcTree9Barrier}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}tree9\\text{-}barrier} \\vdash \\mathrm{FiniteInitialSegment}_S(b,Y)\\leftrightarrow \\exists n\\in\\omega\\;(b=Y\\cap n)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}tree9\\text{-}barrier} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcTree9Barrier}_S(B,X)\\leftrightarrow X\\subseteq\\omega\\land X\\approx\\omega\\land B\\subseteq[X]^{<\\omega}\\land\\forall a,b\\in B\\;(a\\neq b\\to\\neg(a\\subseteq b\\lor b\\subseteq a))\\land\\forall Y\\in[X]^\\omega\\;\\exists b\\in B\\;\\mathrm{FiniteInitialSegment}_S(b,Y)","display":true},{"tex":"Y","display":false},{"tex":"b\\subseteq Y","display":false}],"bytes":1095,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-3824","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch11/58-df-zfc-tree9-barrier.md|58-df-zfc-tree9-barrier]]（batch11）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","28c79fde9f892bfe"]}